    "included": [
      "one unrotated face-up Pokémon base with one ordinary face-up Energy and one current-category face-up Trainer-as-Tool, plus one ordinary base-only active/bench control",
      "native canonical active construction, real leaveAll reverse restoration, active-to-occupied-bench no-target auto-promotion, and targeted return to occupied active on both physical sides",
      "Energy to Trainer to Energy and Trainer to Energy to Trainer current-category cycles through real changeType board departure and ordinary reattachment",
      "logical/direct DOM identity and order, current/original categories, parent wrapper and zone, wrapper width/client width/margin/layers, painted and pre-transform bounds, local/effective rotations, z, safe hit order, synchronous ghost wrappers, two-frame cleanup, source digests, and deny-by-default runtime fulfillment"
    ],
    "excluded": [
      "production React DOM or Pixi parity as fixture data; the browser companion performs the bounded React comparison",
      "more than one Energy or Trainer-as-Tool, evolution attachments, Pokémon-category conversion defects, face-down cards, damage, condition, ability, counters, BREAK, and heterogeneous card dimensions",
      "bench-to-bench reordering, more than one bench control, explicit case-3 active/bench target replacement, resize, fullscreen, explicit board flip, pointer gestures, server, messaging, and network behavior",
      "intermediate loose-board category-cycle geometry and transient ghost-wrapper placement as a candidate-renderer requirement"
    ]
